1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,083
C, potassium iodide.

2
00:00:02,083 --> 00:00:07,174
Iodide is a good enough nucleophile that no copper catalyst is needed.

3
00:00:07,174 --> 00:00:15,611
Copper one chloride is the Sandmeyer route to chlorobenzene, and fluoroboric acid is the Balz Schiemann route to fluorobenzene.

